<title>USA: Robert Half added to S&amp;P Midcap 400 index.</title>
<headline>Robert Half added to S&amp;P Midcap 400 index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Equity Services Group of Standard &amp; Poor's said it would replace FHP International Corp in the S&amp;P MidCap 400 Index with Robert Half International Inc after the close of trading on Tuesday.</p>
<p>PacifiCare Health Systems Inc's acquisition of FHP received regulatory approval on February 14. FHP would be delisted the Nasdaq National Market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Robert Half provides temporary and permanent personnel, specializing in accounting and finance.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
